    "custom_liquid_x7wBpX": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 40px 20px;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__heading {\n    margin: 0 0 28px;\n    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);\n    line-height: 1.15;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__item {\n    border-top: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__item:last-child {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question {\n    position: relative;\n    display: block;\n    width: 100%;\n    padding: 22px 55px 22px 0;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    list-style: none;\n    font-size: 18px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question::-webkit-details-marker {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question::marker {\n    display: none;\n    content: \"\";\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question::after {\n    content: \"+\";\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 5px;\n    top: 50%;\n    transform: translateY(-50%);\n    font-size: 30px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    font-weight: 300;\n    transition: transform 0.2s ease;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__item[open]\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question::after {\n    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer {\n    max-width: 1000px;\n    padding: 0 55px 24px 0;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    color: inherit;\n  }\n\n  .bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer p {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .bowflex-treadmill-faq {\n      padding: 30px 16px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-treadmill-faq__heading {\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n      font-size: 28px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question {\n      padding: 18px 45px 18px 0;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-treadmill-faq__question::after {\n      font-size: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer {\n      padding: 0 35px 20px 0;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section\n  class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq\"\n  aria-labelledby=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq-heading\"\n>\n\n  <h2\n    id=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq-heading\"\n    class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__heading\"\n  >\n    BowFlex Treadmill FAQs\n  </h2>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__question\">\n      Why choose a BowFlex treadmill for home workouts?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        BowFlex treadmills are a strong choice for home workouts because they\n        combine speed, incline training, deck cushioning, foldable design and\n        connected training options in one machine. Instead of choosing between\n        a basic walking treadmill and a full commercial gym treadmill, BowFlex\n        treadmills offer practical home training features for walking, jogging,\n        running, intervals and incline workouts.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__question\">\n      How much space do I need for a BowFlex treadmill at home?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        Please check the product dimensions on the product page and leave\n        enough clearance around the BowFlex treadmill for safe access, running\n        movement, ventilation and emergency dismounting. We recommend\n        measuring your room before purchase, including both the operating and\n        folded dimensions if the model is foldable. If space is limited, the\n        folding BowFlex T6 is a practical option for regular home walking,\n        jogging and running, with stowed dimensions of\n        <strong>111.8 × 89.8 × 172.7 cm</strong>. If you have more space and\n        want a larger running area, the BowFlex T9 offers a\n        <strong>152 × 56 cm / 60\" × 22\"</strong> running surface and stowed\n        dimensions of <strong>123.5 × 94 × 171.6 cm</strong>.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__question\">\n      What running surface size should I choose for home walking, jogging or running?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        For home treadmill training, the running surface should be large enough\n        for your natural stride and workout speed. A compact running surface\n        can work for walking and light jogging, while regular running, taller\n        users, faster speeds and longer workouts usually feel more comfortable\n        with a longer and wider running deck. The BowFlex T6 offers a\n        <strong>50 × 152 cm</strong> running surface for regular home walking,\n        jogging and running. The BowFlex T9 offers a larger\n        <strong>152 × 56 cm / 60\" × 22\"</strong> running surface for users who\n        want more width, longer-stride comfort and a more spacious running feel\n        at home.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__question\">\n      Which BowFlex treadmill is best for home use, T6 or T9?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        Both the BowFlex T6 and BowFlex T9 are designed for home treadmill\n        training, but they suit different needs. The BowFlex T6 is a practical\n        folding treadmill for regular walking, jogging and running at home,\n        with speeds up to <strong>20 km/h / 12 mph</strong>, up to\n        <strong>15% incline</strong>, Bluetooth connectivity, fitness app\n        compatibility and smartwatch syncing. The BowFlex T9 is better suited\n        to users who want more running space, greater stability and a more\n        advanced connected running experience, including a\n        <strong>152 × 56 cm / 60\" × 22\"</strong> running area, speeds up to\n        <strong>20 km/h / 12 mph</strong>, up to <strong>15% incline</strong>\n        and smartwatch syncing features.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n  <details class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__item\">\n    <summary class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__question\">\n      Can BowFlex treadmills connect to fitness apps and connected training features?\n    </summary>\n\n    <div class=\"bowflex-treadmill-faq__answer\">\n      <p>\n        BowFlex treadmill connected training features vary by model. The\n        BowFlex T6 supports app-connected training with\n        <strong>JRNY, Kinomap and Zwift</strong> through a compatible phone or\n        tablet. The BowFlex T9 supports <strong>JRNY, Kinomap and Zwift</strong>\n        and can sync workout data with\n        <strong>Apple Watch and Samsung Galaxy Watch</strong>. The BowFlex\n        T25 / Treadmill 25 includes a built-in touchscreen, Wi-Fi connection,\n        JRNY training, Bluetooth heart rate tracking and Bluetooth speakers.\n        These connected features can help users follow guided workouts, explore\n        virtual routes, track performance data and make indoor running more\n        engaging. Please check the specifications for the model available in\n        your market.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n\n</section>\n\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why choose a BowFlex treadmill for home workouts?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"BowFlex treadmills combine speed, incline training, deck cushioning, foldable design and connected training options in one machine. They support home walking, jogging, running, interval training and incline workouts.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How much space do I need for a BowFlex treadmill at home?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Check the dimensions of your chosen BowFlex treadmill and allow enough clearance for access, running movement, ventilation and emergency dismounting. BowFlex T6 has stowed dimensions of 111.8 × 89.8 × 172.7 cm. BowFlex T9 has stowed dimensions of 123.5 × 94 × 171.6 cm and a 152 × 56 cm / 60 × 22 inch running surface.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What running surface size should I choose for home walking, jogging or running?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"The running surface should provide enough room for your stride and workout speed. BowFlex T6 offers a 50 × 152 cm running surface for regular home walking, jogging and running. BowFlex T9 offers a larger 152 × 56 cm / 60 × 22 inch running surface for users who want more width and longer-stride comfort.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Which BowFlex treadmill is best for home use, T6 or T9?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"BowFlex T6 is a practical folding treadmill for regular home walking, jogging and running, with speeds up to 20 km/h / 12 mph, up to 15% incline, Bluetooth, fitness app compatibility and smartwatch syncing. BowFlex T9 is suited to users who want more running space, greater stability and a more advanced connected running experience.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can BowFlex treadmills connect to fitness apps and connected training features?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Connected features vary by model. BowFlex T6 supports JRNY, Kinomap and Zwift through a compatible phone or tablet. BowFlex T9 supports JRNY, Kinomap and Zwift and can sync workout data with Apple Watch and Samsung Galaxy Watch. BowFlex T25 / Treadmill 25 includes a built-in touchscreen, Wi-Fi, JRNY training, Bluetooth heart rate tracking and Bluetooth speakers.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-5",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    }
